# optimistic claims
rep("- On success, you update the real state (usually inside the same Action) so that when optimistic state is discarded, `value` already equals the intended outcome — so no flicker.",
 "- On success, you update the real state inside the same Action so that when optimistic state is discarded, `value` already equals the intended outcome — so no flicker. **Caveat (sandbox-verified):** a `setState` placed *after* an `await` is not part of the transition (see §2.2), so it commits as an urgent update *while the overlay is still applied*. With an append-style reducer that renders the item twice for one frame (`a, a*`) before the Action ends. Wrapping the post-`await` update in `startTransition(() => setTodos(...))` gives the clean sequence (overlay → real value).")
rep("Note over UI: Action ends → overlay dropped, value now includes saved item (one commit, no flicker)","Note over UI: Action ends → overlay dropped, value now includes saved item (no flicker, provided the post-await update is wrapped in startTransition)")
rep("A->>St: setTodos(add saved item)         %% real state updated inside the Action","A->>St: startTransition(() => setTodos(add saved item))  %% post-await update must be re-wrapped")
rep("4. Action calls `setTodos(prev => [...prev, saved])` (real state, transition update).\n5. Action returns → transition completes; React commits a render where `todos` contains `saved` and no overlay remains. One commit: no flash.",
 "4. Action calls `startTransition(() => setTodos(prev => [...prev, saved]))` (real state; re-wrapped because it runs after an `await`).\n5. Action returns → transition completes; React commits a render where `todos` contains `saved` and no overlay remains. No flash. (Without the re-wrap, the sandbox shows an extra intermediate render in which the list contains both the real item and the still-applied overlay item.)")
rep("// the cache/state update after `await` must be wrapped to remain a transition ⚠","// the cache/state update after `await` must be wrapped to remain a transition")
